                        "url": "https://github.com/andradei"
                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Actual keymap in case anyone finds this:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"<leader><leader>\", function()\r\n\tif not pcall(MiniPick.builtin.resume) then\r\n\t\tvim.notify(\"No active pickers\")\r\n\tend\r\nend, { desc = \"Open last picker\" })\r\n```\r\n\r\nI went this route so I can get *some message* and train my discipline :laughing:.\r\nAlso to remember there's an error there just in case. But @abeldekat's approach is elegant.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Actual keymap in case anyone finds this:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.keymap.set(&quot;n&quot;, &quot;&lt;leader&gt;&lt;leader&gt;&quot;, function()\n\tif not pcall(MiniPick.builtin.resume) then\n\t\tvim.notify(&quot;No active pickers&quot;)\n\tend\nend, { desc = &quot;Open last picker&quot; })\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;leader&gt;&lt;leader&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n\t<span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">not</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">pcall</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniPick</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">builtin</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">resume</span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">then</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">notify</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>No active pickers<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n\t<span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Open last picker<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I went this route so I can get <em>some message</em> and train my discipline 😆.<br>\nAlso to remember there's an error there just in case. But <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/abeldekat/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/abeldekat\">@abeldekat</a>'s approach is elegant.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Actual keymap in case anyone finds this:\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"<leader><leader>\", function()\n\tif not pcall(MiniPick.builtin.resume) then\n\t\tvim.notify(\"No active pickers\")\n\tend\nend, { desc = \"Open last picker\" })\nI went this route so I can get some message and train my discipline 😆.\nAlso to remember there's an error there just in case. But @abeldekat's approach is elegant.",
